  m_text: '<color=#5AD9FF>Shield</color> is your running speed: it <color=#FF6B5A>burns
    off as you run</color> and you slow down with it. Grab <color=#5AD9FF>plasma
    shield orbs</color> to speed back up. <color=#5AD9FF>Vibe</color> is your health.
    <color=#FF6B5A>Game over</color> when Vibe hits 0, the guard catches you, a guard
    shoots you, or you fall off a roof.'
